  "bio": "Discover the artful fusion of tradition and creativity at Oak and Iron Tattooing, Buffalo's premier destination for modern electric tattooing. Specializing in traditional and illustrative ink styles, this full-service salon offers a bespoke tattooing experience, complete with the convenience of online booking. Step into the welcoming ambiance of Oak and Iron and let your skin become the canvas for your next masterpiece. 📞 716.844.8005.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Buffalo, New York, United States"
